# components/

Cross-screen reusable presentational components for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- Base UI primitives (`Button`, `TextField`, `Card`) wrapped in your design
  tokens.
- Layout wrappers (`Screen`, `Section`) used by multiple screens.

## What does NOT live here

- Screen-local components — those live in the screen's own `components/`
  subfolder.
- Components that fetch data — those belong inside a screen or a `features/`
  folder. Components in this directory are presentational only.
- Hooks — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/hooks/` or in a screen's `hooks/` folder.

## Naming

- One component per file. File name matches the component name (`Button.tsx`).
- Sub-components used only by one parent live in the same file as the
  parent, not in their own file.

